  "project.extra": "-- Added to the project of every step of the replay.\n--\n-- mcabal, which Makefile.packages is written for, ignores version bounds.\n-- These lift the few bounds that stand between a package of the list and the\n-- versions of its dependencies that support mhs.\n\n-- The indexed-traversable fork of MicroHs caps containers below 0.8, but\n-- containers-0.7 depends on template-haskell, and 0.8 is the first version\n-- that mhs can build. QuickCheck from git is already 2.19.0.0, which\n-- hspec-core and hspec cap below.\nallow-newer: indexed-traversable:containers, hspec-core:QuickCheck, hspec:QuickCheck\n\n-- xhtml-3000.3 and later import Data.Text.Lazy.Encoding, which the base of\n-- mhs does not have.\nconstraints: xhtml < 3000.3\n",
